The PaliGemma graphs and runtime re-implement the computation of the Hugging Face
Transformers 5.2.0 reference, which this family's tests run as their oracle:
models/paligemma/modeling_paligemma.py and processing_paligemma.py, models/gemma/
modeling_gemma.py, models/siglip/modeling_siglip.py and image_processing_siglip.py:
https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/tree/v5.2.0/src/transformers/models
No source is copied. Those files carry these headers:

