The bicubic resize in runtime/image_preprocess.cpp (cubic filter with A = -0.5,
filter support, 22-bit fixed-point weights, rounding and the separable pass order)
is adapted from Pillow 13.0.0, src/libImaging/Resample.c:
https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/blob/13.0.0/src/libImaging/Resample.c

