The SentencePiece BPE flattening (tokenizer_export.py) and its C++ runtime
(runtime/paligemma_bpe.h and paligemma_bpe.cpp) are copies of this repository's
families/lerobot_pi05 files, with the pi0.5 prompt code removed and a decoder
added; the resize also follows the arithmetic of families/siglip. Both are
covered by this repository's license.
